e":"Introduction and statement of the result","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:453555fbb66c619d75c88f0d36b6c72a8de87d4d2ba858d2e1e64a0f07fbdbd1","file":"preprints/QAOA-attains-the-SK-ground-state-energy-in-the-thermodynamic-first-limit-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":111,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"7bdddbaa519ba0db3889e91b601dc49761f0f5a9ef39f67175660aa32b4d07d4","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/QAOA-attains-the-SK-ground-state-energy-in-the-thermodynamic-first-limit-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:453555fbb66c619d75c88f0d36b6c72a8de87d4d2ba858d2e1e64a0f07fbdbd1","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/QAOA-attains-the-SK-ground-state-energy-in-the-thermodynamic-first-limit-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L111"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor the zero-field SK model~\\eqref{eq:sk-model},\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:main-result}\n \\lim_{p\\to\\infty}Q_p=\\Pstar.\n\\end{equation}\nEquivalently, for every $\\varepsilon>0$ there exist a finite integer $p$ and\ndeterministic real vectors $\\gamma,\\beta\\in\\R^p$, independent of $n$ and $J$,\nsuch that $v_p(\\gamma,\\beta)\\ge\\Pstar-\\varepsilon$."}
